<resources>
    <!-- ===== TV Home configuration =====================================
         dock_pkg / dock_label / dock_data / dock_icon are index aligned.
         dock_data empty string  -> plain app launch
         dock_data "https://..." -> open that URL inside the same package
    ===================================================================== -->

